            </item>
            <item>
                <key>custodian_organisation</key>
                <value>FMUP - Faculty of Medicine, University of Porto</value>
            </item>
            <item>
                <key>references</key>
                <value>1. Ohayon M, et al. National Sleep Foundation's sleep quality recommendations. Sleep Health. 2017;3(1):6-19.
2. Berry RB, et al. AASM Manual for the Scoring of Sleep. American Academy of Sleep Medicine; 2020.
3. de Zambotti M, et al. Wearable Sleep Technology in Clinical and Research Settings. Med Sci Sports Exerc. 2019;51(7):1538-1557.
4. Roomkham S, et al. Promises and Challenges in the Use of Consumer-Grade Devices for Sleep Monitoring. IEEE Rev Biomed Eng. 2018;11:53-67.</value>
            </item>
            <item>
                <key>FHIR_mapping</key>
                <value>Maps to SleepObservation profile in iOS Lifestyle Medicine FHIR IG. LOINC codes: Sleep duration (93832-4)</value>
            </item>
        </other_details>
    </description>
